  ('Electrical', 'Ceiling and shower lights', 'bath', 'rough_in', 2, 'Lights over a shower must be wet-rated and go in before insulation.', 73),
  ('Electrical', 'Outlets in the vanity or medicine cabinet', 'bath', 'rough_in', 2, 'Hidden outlets for hair tools and toothbrushes are wired at rough-in.', 74),
