  ('Doors & trim', 'Floor transition at the bathroom door', 'bath', 'finish', 2, 'Tile is often thicker than the hallway floor, so the joint needs a plan.', 85),
  ('Cabinets', 'Linen storage', 'bath', 'cabinets', 6, 'A linen cabinet or closet is ordered with the vanity or framed early.', 86),
